changelog: |
  0.2.0 — layout capture. scripts/layout_capture.mjs loads each surface at
  375/768/1280px and writes a geometry snapshot, a wireframe SVG drawn from it
  and a screenshot per page and width, with rendered-layout rules L1–L6 (page
  pans sideways, current item clipped, squeezed label, indented column, long
  lead, hidden scroller) and a provisional score; scripts/layout_compare.mjs
  diffs two runs (rules fixed/introduced, boxes resized/added/removed, optional
  pixel diff) and compares one role across sites by its anchors. Warn-only by
  default (--fail-on to gate); a run that captured nothing exits 2. The hub
  runs it over the registry's ux.surfaces as `dash ux`. Tests: tests/ (fixtures,
  no network), run by .github/workflows/ux-audit-selftest.yml.
  0.1.0 — initial kit. Closes the UPS-FE-53/60 gap named in specs/FRONTEND.md
  (`templates/ux-audit/`). Ships: portable R1–R13 computational audit
  (stdlib-only), Playwright evidence collector MVP, PR gate workflow outline,
  specialist critique prompts, and leaf ux.yml manifest example.
  Reference implementation for app-specific rules: bamr87/law-ai scripts/ux_audit.py.
  OPT-IN fan-out only — never part of the default standardize artifact set.
notes: |
  Seed into a leaf repo only when projects.yml has ux.enabled: true (or the
  maintainer opts in). Additive-only: never overwrite an existing ux.yml,
  scripts/ux_audit.py, or .github/workflows/ux-gate.yml unless --upgrade and
  the target is byte-identical to archive/.
